    "item": [
      "Restate the word-size rule as {0,1,2,4}, with swap and modulo applying only when word_size > 1 (cite 440-443, 471, 476)",
      "Restate the mode rule as 'a LOADABLE mime.cache (>=40 bytes, version 1.1/1.2) anywhere' (cite xdgmimecache.c:63-65,128,137-139; xdgmime.c:137-154,532-535) and make the case-file rule use 'loadable', not 'holds a mime.cache'",
